_notice() {
	cat <<'EOF'
Firefox holds an add-on of the system directory disabled. Open about:addons
one time and enable QtCurve there.

The writer of the qtcurve package carries the whole look into each Firefox
profile. Turn on "Apply the settings to Firefox" in the QtCurve settings
dialogue, and set toolkit.legacyUserProfileCustomizations.stylesheets to true
in about:config.

Firefox takes a change of the theme or of the sheet after a restart.
EOF
}

post_install() {
	_notice
}

post_upgrade() {
	_notice
}

post_remove() {
	cat <<'EOF'
The writer of the qtcurve package writes a style sheet into each Firefox
profile of a user. Run qtcurve-firefox-writer --remove to delete those files.
pacman deletes no file under a home directory.
EOF
}
